{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8dd45398f51b0771cd9383f9f9af888615573ebaded15108725fe35b4b2133ed", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』に向け、星梨花たちは\n稽古や取材など、忙しい日々を送っている）", "zh": "（为了《STARDOM ROAD》，星梨花她们每天都忙于排练、接受采访等工作）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "4ee4ce184c18f1be87ac2861b352c17b2a3b8597f066451e518e71734d95bbc3", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n雑誌のグラビア撮影、終わりました！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n杂志的写真拍摄结束了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4813af7eb82fab621a125eca424d3026cfdc3f89930566230aa81faaec4a7cc1", "ja": "お疲れ様、星梨花。\nうん、すごくいい感じに撮ってもらえたと思うよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花。\n嗯，我觉得拍得特别好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "a7ef2a954f444b610748207c6bddf86546c0dd7d1113d372f9c298f9cc148be8", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとうございます！", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "07fd4ed35bde96435bd0f36a2556334ba40b89fa01d6194719869c10340cc6de", "ja": "この後は、パンフレット用の\nインタビューがあるんですよね？", "zh": "接下来还有为宣传册准备的采访，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1005_p", "source_sha256": "998ddf10c3c03006194e088d76245c716736ecd26e34898906720086b9ca84f9", "ja": "ああ。開始までまだ時間があるから、\n少しゆっくりしているといいよ。", "zh": "嗯。离开始还有一段时间，你先稍微休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "335c08fa64a2548a57b94b97332bdea307b0121991f3bea84c8034f9f06a2c86", "ja": "わかりました。それなら、台本を読んでおこうかな……\n昨日言われたところも、復習しておかなくちゃ。", "zh": "明白了。那我先读读剧本吧……\n昨天被指出的地方，也得复习一下才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1349f5c059e94946ca939a1102e5daf2cca0c18f632a7ea3d8e4c29f297394e9", "ja": "熱心なのは感心だけど、休まなくても大丈夫か？\n昨日も1日中稽古だったし、疲れも溜まってるだろ？", "zh": "热心是好事，不过一直不休息也没关系吗？昨天也排练了整整1天，疲劳都积攒不少了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "53b274be1d7fe19491531cd3d462320cda23e4ea9973eb9428c65a84505927fd", "ja": "そうですね。すっごく忙しくて、\n目が回っちゃいそうな時もありますけど……。", "zh": "是啊。虽然特别忙，有时候忙得都快晕头转向了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "594133a16d927bf204c3ad7905f63ea4296ff02100564a857c9dfc793fa64872", "ja": "でも今は、大変だなって思うより、\nとっても楽しいんです！", "zh": "不过现在，比起觉得辛苦，我更觉得特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "af8f23e3a0b654faab211aa4a0762022ae0e0223c1de1665149d6a0b12740024", "ja": "わたしにできることがあるなら、挑戦したいんです。\nえっと……ダメ、ですか？", "zh": "只要是我能做到的事，我都想去挑战。\n那个……不可以，吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1011_p", "source_sha256": "28e80115c4160d66c58578b3778956de250673b70fc8204d26d821515132a5f5", "ja": "（無理をしている感じじゃないな。仕事への\nモチベーションが高くて、満ち足りてるってところか）", "zh": "（看起来不像是在勉强自己。应该是对工作的干劲很足，也感到十分充实吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4952038cd4c941ba56c5a90e9f847c8c17ca2a02a2660af6067e17932eab0952", "ja": "わかった、そういう事なら、問題ない。\n良い舞台にできるように、応援してる！", "zh": "明白了，既然是这样，就没问题了。\n为了让演出顺利进行，我会为你加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "a329a7f5b4a6c186ebd24fdff57e5167bcf389a7a5212efdb78e5abba4e60145", "ja": "はいっ。わたし、がんばります！", "zh": "好的！我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1014_p", "source_sha256": "79494fbc8cb363e54d81f49d8f9db9c138dcbd0b36e0595b21b9e26ac8bcc728", "ja": "（今の星梨花に必要なのは、心配より、頑張る背中を\n後押しすることなのかもしれない。それなら……）", "zh": "（现在的星梨花需要的，或许不是担心她，而是推她一把，让她勇敢努力。如果是这样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "fa5bfd5e7d23e5f6a715c3295d054fd33e73fae9c0b2b046bd24ede047a80edc", "ja": "ふぅ～……これで、今日の予定は全部終わりですね！\n全部ちゃんとできて、よかったです。", "zh": "呼——……这样一来，今天的安排就全部完成了呢！\n能顺利全部完成，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1016_p", "source_sha256": "eaeb95833f5a7d12f60db0dfbca542b55ca49aac78284c907447977baa312869", "ja": "今日は本当にお疲れ様。頑張った星梨花に、ご褒美だ。\nどうぞ。", "zh": "今天真的辛苦了。这是给努力了的星梨花的奖励。\n给。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "2a6f20d7ba312dbe1af2be8aa2f3e23d4b45c459b66ce50e02836c17e33f3473", "ja": "あ、紅茶味のクッキー！　{$P$}さん\nわざわざ用意してくれたんですか？", "zh": "啊，是红茶味的曲奇！{$P$}先生\n是特意准备给我的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "b2c36d4f119bf81c85469e26dde491b88b9b4027ff6b92ea24aab501f6d4aa4e", "ja": "ありがとうございます、大事に食べますね！\nえへへ……♪", "zh": "谢谢您，我会珍惜着吃的！\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0493_1019_p", "source_sha256": "58e37fbf4045d1dbcac9228faff9c7224d7a386c02498190c3bc913410acca3c", "ja": "（これだけのモチベーションがあるんだ。きっと、\n最高の舞台にできるはずだ……頑張れ、星梨花！）", "zh": "（有这么高的干劲，一定能把舞台做到最棒……加油，星梨花！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
